in which he had all of his students order.

37
00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:10.560
You know,

38
00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:11.920
they each had their own copy of the book,

39
00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:14.240
and they would spend the first couple
of minutes of class

40
00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:17.240
actually like comparing their copies
with each other.

41
00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:21.520
And it was kind of thrown off track
because they had to do it online

42
00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:22.520
because they were on zoom.

43
00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:25.000
So it didn't have quite the same feel.

44
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:28.960
But one of the things that Andrew said
