45
00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:33.120
because every copy is so different
from each other, it defies one of the

46
00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:37.280
hallmark tools of textual scholarship,
which is the very aurum,

47
00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:40.880
which is where you compare
multiple copies of a text side by side.

48
00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:44.240
And when I taught subcutaneous

